 "text": "Weiter zum Hauptinhalt\n\nWhy justclaims.eu\n\nAbout us\n\nResources\n\nRequest a Demo\n“A walk in the park from day one.”\n\n\n\nOur CEO and co-founder Ulrich Steppler has been interviewed by eLegal, an initiative of legal tech enthusiasts and students from Georg-August University, Göttingen, Germany, and namely Philipp Kürth. Ulrich talks about his dual role as partner and CEO and how the idea to develop a fully automated claims handling platform could spring to life next to his day job as an aviation attorney.\n\n\n\n\nSource: https://www.xn--elegal-gttingen-gtb.de/interviews/ulrich-steppler\n\n\n\n\n\nAktuelle Beiträge\nAlle ansehen\nEurowings Discover forciert schnelle Streitbeilegung mit justclaims.eu\nEurowings Discover pushes fast dispute resolution with justclaims.eu\nEurowings Discover optimizes complaint management with justclaims.eu\nKommentare\nLadevorgang läuft...\n\nCHS Claims Handling Solutions GmbH \n\nGüterplatz 1\n60327 Frankfurt am Main\n\n​\n\nT +49 69 380 299 910\nF +49 69 380 299 911\n\nImprint\n\nPrivacy Policy",
